# `tsc` output. The gate RUNS `dist/`, but it is rebuilt by `npm run build` on
# every invocation — a committed copy would be a second source of truth for the
# same code, and the stale one always wins an argument.
dist/

# The emitted per-atom row list (`npm run emitted-atoms`) — a MEASUREMENT, not a
# source. Regenerated by re-running the leg; a committed copy would be a second
# source of truth for a number the leg exists to take.
.atoms/
